{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8upzvSwNgiU75KipAy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"prompt\": \"A square abstract painting that fills the entire image edge to edge, with no frame, border, wall, room, or gallery setting. Purely nonrepresentational: no recognizable objects, figures, faces, bodies, scenes, landscapes, horizons, machines, diagrams, symbols, icons, letters, numbers, or text. Palette: a deep, cool indigo-black ground with a restrained band of ochre and cadmium orange pressing in from the lower right, and small, controlled islands of pale grey-blue that hold their ground against the warmth. Brushwork: layered, scraped, and re-worked. Broad dry-brush gestures sweep diagonally from upper left toward center, with a few thin, deliberate lines that stop short, as if hesitating. Texture: thick impasto in the warm areas, almost smooth glazes in the cool ones, with visible scraping marks where paint was removed and reapplied. Composition: dense, layered clusters on the right and lower half create weight and pressure; the upper left and center are kept open, with generous empty space that feels deliberate rather than unfinished. Spatial tension: the warm mass seems to lean toward the cool zone without breaking into it. Rhythm: a repeated, irregular cadence of strokes, slightly accelerating toward the lower right and then pausing. Overall mood: contained urgency, careful restraint, and the sense of many competing pressures held in balance without resolution.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":510,"cache_read_input_tokens":17303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":510},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use